  "description": "Apartamento em Rua 1º de Maio, Albufeira.\nDisponível a partir de 01/12/2026.\nEstadia mínima: 1 mês.\nCaução: 200 €.\nDespesas incluídas.\nReferência Spacest: 253171\n\nApartment in Rua 1º de Maio, Albufeira.\nAvailable from 01/12/2026.\nMinimum stay: 1 month.\nDeposit: 200 €.\nBills included.\nSpacest reference: 253171\n\nEscape to the Algarve with a stay in this spacious T3 holiday apartment in Guia, designed for families or groups of up to 8 people. Perfect for a relaxing holiday, this apartment features two double bedrooms and a third with four single beds, ideal for kids or friends. With four bathrooms, including three ensuite, privacy and comfort are ensured.\n\nThe modern kitchen is fully equipped with a microwave, coffee machine, dishwasher, and washing machine, making it convenient for longer stays. The airy living room opens to a private balcony, while another balcony is accessible from one of the bedrooms, perfect for soaking up the Algarve sun.\n\nSet within a private condominium, you’ll enjoy access to a shared swimming pool, ideal for unwinding after a day exploring the nearby beaches or attractions like Zoomarine. The apartment is close to local restaurants, shops, and attractions, providing everything you need for a stress-free and memorable stay in Guia, Algarve. Please note, there is a kindergarten located in front of the property, and during weekdays, there may be some noise from school activities.\n\nWhether you're here for a family getaway or a group trip, this stylish and centrally located T3 apartment offers the perfect base to experience the best of the Algarve.",
